  "reasoning": "The defendant used scanning and printing equipment to create counterfeit samples of Chinese currency (1, 5, 10, 20 yuan) and knowingly supplied these fake currency templates to another person who intended to produce counterfeit money. This conduct constitutes the crime of counterfeiting currency under Chinese criminal law (伪造货币罪). No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so only this charge applies.",
